AB  - (no language specified) The document aims to get you up and running with AMS-LaTeX as quickly as possible. These instructions 
      (along with a template file  template.tex ) are not a substitute for the full documentation, but 
      they may get you started quickly enough so that you will only need to refer to the main documentation 
      occasionally.

      In addition to ‘AMS-LaTeX out of the box’, the document contains:

      + a section describing how to draw commutative diagrams using  Xy-pic (https://ctan.org/pkg/xypic) ; 
        and
      + a section describing how to use  amsrefs (https://ctan.org/pkg/amsrefs) to create a bibliography.
