AB  - (no language specified) A LaTeX class to format text according to the American Psychological Association Publication Manual (5th 
      ed.) specifications for manuscripts or to the APA journal look found in journals like the Journal of 
      Experimental Psychology etc. In addition, it provides regular LaTeX-like output with a few enhancements 
      and APA-motivated changes.

      Note that the  apa7 (https://ctan.org/pkg/apa7) class (covering the 7th edition of the manual) 
      and apa6 (https://ctan.org/pkg/apa6) (covering the 6th edition of the manual) are now commonly 
      in use.

       Apacite (https://ctan.org/pkg/apacite) , which used to work with this class, 
      has been updated for use with apa6 (https://ctan.org/pkg/apa6) .
