      APA manual, and is designed to work with the  apa6 (https://ctan.org/pkg/apa6) class. A test document 
      is provided. The package is compatible with chapterbib (https://ctan.org/pkg/chapterbib) and (to 
      some extent) with hyperref (https://ctan.org/pkg/hyperref) (for limits of compatibility, see the 
      documentation). The package also includes a means of generating an author index for a document.
