T1  - apxproof
T2  - Proofs in appendix
AU  - Senellart, Pierre
Y2  - 2026-04-14
PY  - 2026
AB  - (no language specified) The package makes it easier to write articles where proofs and other material are deferred to the appendix.

      The appendix material is written in the LaTeX code along with the main text which it naturally complements, 
      and it is automatically deferred.

      The package can automatically send proofs to the appendix, can repeat in the appendix the theorem environments 
      stated in the main text, can section the appendix automatically based on the sectioning of the main text, 
      and supports a separate bibliography for the appendix material.

      It depends on the following other packages:  amsthm (https://ctan.org/pkg/amsthm) , bibunits 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/bibunits) (if the bibliography option is set to separate ), environ 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/environ) , etoolbox (https://ctan.org/pkg/etoolbox) , fancyvrb (https://ctan.org/pkg/fancyvrb) , ifthen 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/ifthen) , and kvoptions (https://ctan.org/pkg/kvoptions) .
