      separate files, rather than within the document, as is standard in the asymptote package, which 
      is provided as part of the Asymptote bundle. The asymptote way can prove cumbersome in a large 
      document; the present package allows the user to process one picture at a time, in simple test documents, 
      and then to migrate (with no fuss) to their use in the target document.
