AU  - Staats III, Charles
Y2  - 2025-01-26
PY  - 2025
AB  - (no language specified) The package is an unofficial alternative to the package provided with the  Asymptote (https://ctan.org/pkg/asymptote) distribution, 
      for including pictures within a LaTeX source file.

      While it does not duplicate all the features of the official package, this package is more user-friendly 
      in several ways. Most notably, Asymptote errors are repackaged as LaTeX errors, making debugging less 
      of a pain. It also has a more robust mechanism for identifying unchanged pictures that need not be recompiled.
