AB  - (no language specified) This class is a wrapper around the beamer class to make it easier to use the same document to generate 
      the different forms of the presentation: the slides themselves, an abbreviated slide set for transparencies 
      or online reference, an n-up handout version (various layouts are provided), and a transcript or set 
      of notes using the article class.

      The class provides a variety of handout layouts, and allows the mode to be chosen from the command line 
      (without changing the document itself).
