AB  - (no language specified) This package provides a LaTeX class for typesetting books with a colorful design.

      Currently, it has native support for Chinese (both simplified and traditional), English, French, German, 
      Italian, Japanese, Portuguese (European and Brazilian), Russian and Spanish typesetting. It compiles 
      with either XeLaTeX or LuaLaTeX.

      This is part of the  colorist (https://ctan.org/pkg/colorist) class series and depends on colorist.sty from 
      the colorist (https://ctan.org/pkg/colorist) package.

      The package name “beaulivre” is taken from the French words “beau” (= “beautiful”) and “livre” (= “book”).
