AB  - (no language specified) This is a fairly complete  BibLaTeX (https://ctan.org/pkg/biblatex) style (citations and references) 
      for APA (American Psychological Association) publications. It implements and automates most of the guidelines 
      in the APA 7th edition style guide for citations and references. An example document is also given which 
      typesets every citation and reference example in the APA 7th edition style guide.

      This version of the package requires use of  csquotes ≥4.3 (https://ctan.org/pkg/csquotes) , BibLaTeX 
      ≥3.4 (https://ctan.org/pkg/biblatex) , and the biber (https://ctan.org/pkg/biber) backend for BibLaTeX 
      ≥2.5 (https://ctan.org/pkg/biblatex) .
