AB  - (no language specified) This package provides additional  BibLaTeX (https://ctan.org/pkg/biblatex) styles for German humanities. 
      Its core purpose is to enable the referencing rules of the Romano-Germanic Commission ( '&gt;Römisch-Germanische 
      Kommission' ), the department of prehistory of the German Archaeological Institute ( 'Deutsches 
      Archäologisches Institut' ), since these are referenced by most guidelines in German prehistory and 
      medieval archaeology and serve as a kind of template. biblatex-archaeology provides verbose, numeric 
      and author date styles as well and adaptions to specific document types like exhibition and auction catalogues.
