AB  - (no language specified) This is a  BibLaTeX (https://ctan.org/pkg/biblatex) style that combines the features of the styles 
      authoryear-comp (omission of recurring author/year in multiple-reference-citations) and authoryear-ibid 
      (replacement of repeated citations by the abbreviation ibidem). The implementation relies heavily on 
      unmodified BibLaTeX macros, and no attempt has been made to add further features not present in core 
      BibLaTeX.
