      as GB/T 7714-1987, GB/T 7714-2005, GB/T 7714-2015, GB/T 7714-2025.

      The package also provides several liberal arts bibliography styles, such as chinese-erj, chinese-css, 
      chinese-jmw, and so on. These styles can be used simply by loading BibLaTeX with the appropriate option.
