AU  - Hansen, Thorsten
AB  - (no language specified) The package provide a mechanism to generate separate bibliographies for different units (chapters, sections 
      or bibunit-environments) of a text. The package separates the citations of each unit of text into a separate 
      file to be processed by BibTeX. The global bibliography section produced by LaTeX may also appear in 
      the document and citations can be placed in both the local unit and the global bibliographies at the 
      same time.

      The package is compatible with  koma-script (https://ctan.org/pkg/koma-script) and with the babel 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/babel) French option frenchb.
