      graphics package so it is no longer necessary to provide a separate bounding box files for bitmap images. 
      Additionally the implementation for the inclusion of bitmap images in some drivers of package  graphicx 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/graphicx) are rewritten to support options viewport, trim and clip. The package 
      requires pdfTeX (https://ctan.org/pkg/pdftex) version 1.30.0 or later (the relevant pdfTeX primitive 
      operates in both DVI and PDF output modes).

      The package is part of the  oberdiek (https://ctan.org/pkg/oberdiek) bundle.
