      +  Roman Rustic (1st–6th centuries) (https://ctan.org/pkg/rustic) ;
      +  Insular Minuscule (6th cenury onwards) (https://ctan.org/pkg/inslrmin) ;
      +  Carolingian Minuscule (8th–12th centuries) (https://ctan.org/pkg/carolmin) ;
      +  Early Gothic (11th–12th centuries) (https://ctan.org/pkg/egothic) ;
      +  Gothic Textura Quadrata (13th–15th centuries) (https://ctan.org/pkg/tgothic) ;
      +  Gothic Textura Prescisus vel sine pedibus (13th century onwards) (https://ctan.org/pkg/pgothic) ;

      +  Rotunda (13–15th centuries) (https://ctan.org/pkg/rotunda) ;
      +  Humanist Minuscule (14th century onwards) (https://ctan.org/pkg/humanist) ;
      +  Uncial (3rd–6th centuries) (https://ctan.org/pkg/uncial) ;
      +  Half Uncial (3rd–9th centuries) (https://ctan.org/pkg/huncial) ;
      +  Artificial Uncial (6th–10th centuries) (https://ctan.org/pkg/auncial) ; and
      +  Insular Majuscule (6th–9th centuries) (https://ctan.org/pkg/inslrmaj) .
