AU  - Carlisle, David
AU  - Musa, Ahmed
AB  - (no language specified) The package changes package loading internals so that all subsequently loaded packages can rely on normal/standard 
      catcodes of all ASCII characters. The package defines canonical control sequences to represent all the 
      visible ASCII characters. It also provides robust option parsing mechanisms ( XDeclareOption , XExecuteOptions and XProcessOptions , 
      which will be used by \documentclass if the package has already been loaded). The package also 
      provides a range of other TeX programming tools.
