      text and other content in Beamer slides. It offers six annotation styles: ellipse, underline, box with 
      fill and border, arrow, and strikethrough. Each style is available in five colors: red, blue, green, 
      orange, and purple. The resulting annotations look more realistic than pure TikZ decorations. The package 
      works with XeLaTeX and LuaLaTeX.
