AU  - Kuznetsov, Alexey
Y2  - 2024-07-10
PY  - 2024
AB  - (no language specified) The  chemformula (https://ctan.org/pkg/chemformula) package and babel-russian (https://ctan.org/pkg/babel-russian) settings 
      ( russian.ldf ) both define macros named “ \ch ”.

      The package  chemformula-ru undefines babel’s macro to prevent an error when both packages are 
      loaded together.

      Optionally it redefines the  \cosh macro to print the hyperbolic cosine in Russian notation and/or 
      defines a new macro \Ch for that purpose.
