TY  - ICOMM
UR  - https://ctan.org/pkg/chemmacros
Y3  - 2025-02-07
T1  - chemmacros
T2  - A collection of macros to support typesetting chemistry documents
AU  - Niederberger, Clemens
AB  - (no language specified) The bundle offers a collection of macros and commands which are intended to make typesetting chemistry 
      documents faster and more convenient. Coverage includes some nomenclature commands, oxidation numbers, 
      thermodynamic data, newman projections, etc.

      The package relies on the following supporting packages:

      +  chemformula (https://ctan.org/pkg/chemformula) , providing a command for typesetting chemical 
        formulae and reactions (doing a similar task to that of mhchem (https://ctan.org/pkg/mhchem) );

      +  chemgreek (https://ctan.org/pkg/chemgreek) , offering support for use of greek letters; and
      +  ghsystem (https://ctan.org/pkg/ghsystem) , providing for the UN globally harmonised chemical notation.

The packages are written using current versions of the  experimental LaTeX 3 coding conventions (https://ctan.org/pkg/expl3) and 
      the LaTeX 3 support packages (https://ctan.org/pkg/l3packages) .
