      is all-caps (similar to Trajan (https://ctan.org/pkg/trajan) and Michelangelo), but is available 
      in three weights (Regular, Bold, Black). There are no italic fonts, but there are Decorative variants, 
      which can be selected by the usual italic-selection commands in the package’s LaTeX support.
