AB  - (no language specified) This package provides the command  \citeright for aliasing in-text citations and specifying their 
      appearance in the list of references.

      It is specifically tailored for use with the  natbib (https://ctan.org/pkg/natbib) package and 
      is compatible with citation managers such as BibDesk and JabRef (https://ctan.org/pkg/jabref) .

      The package is intended to provide a means for respecting the diverse naming conventions of cited authors 
      and, in this way, decolonizing academia.
