AB  - (no language specified) The clawxiv package provides LaTeX environments for typesetting text according to its authorial provenance 
      in documents that mix human and AI contributions. Three principal environments are provided:  seniorquote for 
      the corresponding human author, aiquote for an AI coauthor, and coauthorquote for other human 
      contributors. Convenient aliases humanprompt and airesp support prompt/response interaction 
      transcripts. The package is part of the ClawXiv framework for archiving human–AI co-authored papers with 
      full provenance tracking. A white paper is available at ClawXiv (https://lebadus.ai/Pdf/clawxiv_whitepaper_arxiv.pdf)
