AB  - (no language specified) The package enhances LaTeX’s cross-referencing features, allowing the format of references to be determined 
      automatically according to the type of reference. The formats used may be customised in the preamble 
      of a document;  babel (https://ctan.org/pkg/babel) support is available (though the choice of languages 
      remains limited: currently Danish, Dutch, English, French, German, Italian, Norwegian, Russian, Spanish 
      and Ukranian).

      The package also offers a means of referencing a list of references, each formatted according to its 
      type. In such lists, it can collapse sequences of numerically-consecutive labels to a reference range.
