TY  - ICOMM
UR  - https://ctan.org/pkg/cmsrb
Y3  - 2025-02-07
T1  - cmsrb
T2  - Computer Modern for Serbian and Macedonian
AU  - Stefanović, Uroš
Y2  - 2020-03-30
PY  - 2020
AB  - (no language specified) This package provides provides Adobe Type 1 Computer Modern fonts for the Serbian and Macedonian languages.

      Although the  cm-super (https://ctan.org/pkg/cm-super) package provides great support for cyrillic 
      script in various languages, there remains a problem with italic variants of some letters for Serbian 
      and Macedonian.

      This package includes the correct shapes for italic letters  \cyrb , \cyrg , \cyrd , \cyrp , 
      and \cyrt . It also offers some improvements in letters and accents used in the Serbian language.

      Supported encodings are: T1, T2A, TS1, X2 and OT2. The OT2 encoding is modified so that it is now easy 
      to transcribe Latin text to Cyrillic.
