Y3  - 2025-02-07
T1  - cntperchap
T2  - Store counter values per chapter
AU  - Hupfer, Christian
Y2  - 2015-06-01
PY  - 2015
AB  - (no language specified) This package stores values of counters (which have been registered beforehand) on a per chapter base 
      and provides the values on demand in the 2nd LaTeX compilation run. In this way it is possible to know 
      how many sections etc. there are lying ahead and to react to these counter values, if needed.

      This is a preliminary version that has been tested with  book.cls (https://ctan.org/pkg/book) , memoir.cls 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/memoir) , and scrbook.cls (https://ctan.org/pkg/scrbook) .

      The packages  assoccnt (https://ctan.org/pkg/assoccnt) (by the same author) and xparse (https://ctan.org/pkg/xparse) are 
      needed as well.
