TY  - ICOMM
UR  - https://ctan.org/pkg/combinedgraphics
Y3  - 2025-02-07
T1  - combinedgraphics
T2  - Include graphic (EPS or PDF)/LaTeX combinations
AU  - Schneider, Christian
AB  - (no language specified) This package provides a macro ( \includecombinedgraphics ) for the inclusion of combined EPS/LaTeX 
      and PDF/LaTeX graphics (an export format of Gnuplot (https://ctan.org/pkg/gnuplot) , Xfig (https://ctan.org/pkg/xfig) , 
      and maybe other programs). Instead of including the graphics with a simple \input , the \includecombinedgraphics macro 
      has some comforts:

      + changing the font and color of the text of the LaTeX part; rescaling the graphics without affecting the 
        font of the LaTeX part;
      + automatic inclusion of the vector graphics part, as far as LaTeX part does not do it (e.g., for files 
        exported from Gnuplot before version 4.2); and
      + rescaling and rotating of complete graphics (similar to  \includegraphics from the graphicx 
        (https://ctan.org/pkg/graphicx) package).
UR  - https://ctan.org/tex-archive/macros/latex/contrib/combinedgraphics/combinedgraphics.pdf
