AU  - Voß, Herbert
AB  - (no language specified) All CTAN packages are saved as bibdata with the entry type  @manual , which can easily be changed 
      by any editor via the replace function. For the old BibTeX program you have to define your bibliography 
      style file, eg ctan.bst . For Biber (https://ctan.org/pkg/biber) resp. BibLaTeX (https://ctan.org/pkg/biblatex) there 
      exists an own ctan.bbx file which uses the data fields:

       title , subtitle , author , date , version , license , url , pkgurl , note .

       ctan.bbx is based on authortitle which can be changed easily in the file.

      The file  ctan.bib will be updated on a daily basis.
