Y3  - 2025-02-07
T1  - currfile
T2  - Provide file name and path of input files
AU  - Scharrer, Martin
Y2  - 2024-03-14
PY  - 2024
AB  - (no language specified) The package provides macros holding file name information (directory, base name, extension, full name 
      and full path) for files read by LaTeX  \input and \include macros; it uses the file hooks 
      provided by the author’s filehook (https://ctan.org/pkg/filehook) . In particular, it restores 
      the parent file name after the trailing \clearpage of an \include d file; as a result, the 
      macros may be usefully employed in the page header and footer of the last printed page of such a file.

      The depth of inclusion is made available, together with the “parent” (including file) and “parents” (all 
      including files to the root of the tree).

      The package supersedes  FiNK (https://ctan.org/pkg/fink) .
