AU  - Talbot, Nicola
AB  - (no language specified) The datatool-regions bundle provides the language-independent region ldf files for the  datatool (https://ctan.org/pkg/datatool) package 
      (v3.0+). The *.ldf files should all be placed on TeX's path.

      These files don't require any explicit loading. They will automatically be input by  datatool-base.sty (or 
      relevant supplementary package) if they are found and required by the tracklang localisation settings. 
      See the datatool v3.0+ and tracklang user manuals for further details.

      The region files deal with defining the currency symbol, and may additionally (if not dependent on the 
      language) set the number group and decimal characters, and provide functions for parsing numeric dates 
      and times.

      If a pre-3.0 version of datatool is installed, these ldf files will be ignored.
