TY  - ICOMM
UR  - https://ctan.org/pkg/datepicker-pro
Y3  - 2025-02-07
T1  - datepicker-pro
T2  - Create a popup datepicker using SWF
AU  - Story, Donald P.
Y2  - 2020-08-07
PY  - 2020
AB  - (no language specified) One of the (many) deficiencies of Adobe Acrobat Reader/Adobe Acrobat is that they have never supported 
      a proper date picker. This package now supplies one. The  \datepicker command creates a readonly 
      text field and a push button to its right. Pressing on the pushbutton brings forth an SWF file displaying 
      a calendar. The user then chooses a date from the calendar, and the date is transferred to the text field.

      This is a “pro” application, which, in the jargon of AeB, means that Adobe Distiller is required as the 
      PDF creator. The only drivers supported, as a result, are dvips and dvipsone.

      As with all such special features, to experience the datepicker, Adobe Reader or Acrobat are needed. 
      Most other PDF readers do not support form field, rich media annotations, and JavaScript.

      This package has become obsolete as of December 2020. Since December 2020, Adobe no longer supports Flash 
      player (SWF, FLV). This package uses a custom SWF file ( datepicker3.swf , eg); as a result this 
      package will no longer function in Adobe Acrobat Reader DC. The package will continue to produce PDFs 
      as designed, but only if built using Acrobat XI (or a version of Acrobat prior to December 2020) and 
      viewed in Adobe Acrobat Reader XI (or a version of Reader prior to December 2020).
UR  - https://ctan.org/tex-archive/obsolete/macros/latex/contrib/datepicker-pro/README.md
