Y3  - 2025-02-07
T1  - datetime2
T2  - Formats for dates, times and time zones
AU  - Talbot, Nicola
Y2  - 2021-03-21
PY  - 2021
AB  - (no language specified) This package provides commands for formatting dates, times and time zones and redefines  \today to 
      use the same formatting style. In addition to \today , you can also use \DTMcurrenttime (current 
      time) or \DTMnow (current date and time). Dates and times can be saved for later use.

      The accompanying  datetime2-calc package can be used to convert date-times to UTC+00:00.

      Language and regional support is provided by independently maintained and installed modules.

      The  datetime2-calc package uses the pgfcalendar package (part of the PGF/TikZ (https://ctan.org/pkg/pgf) bundle).

      This package replaces  datetime.sty (https://ctan.org/pkg/datetime) which is now obsolete.
