T2  - English Full Text styles for the datetime2 package
AU  - Talbot, Nicola
Y2  - 2015-04-01
PY  - 2015
AB  - (no language specified) English date and time styles that use words for the numbers and ordinals.

      This package provides the following date and time styles: “en-fulltext”, “en-FullText”, “en-FULLTEXT”, 
      and the additional time style “en-Fulltext”. (The date equivalent can be obtained through commands like 
       \Today .)

      Unlike the base styles provided by  datetime2.sty (https://ctan.org/pkg/datetime2) , these styles 
      aren't expandable styles. This means that you can't use the date or time in PDF bookmarks or in the argument 
      of certain commands, such as \MakeUppercase , while these styles are in use.
