T1  - datetime2-english
T2  - English language module for the datetime2 package
AU  - Talbot, Nicola
Y2  - 2019-10-21
PY  - 2019
AB  - (no language specified) This module provides the following styles that can be set using  \DTMsetstyle provided by datetime2.sty 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/datetime2) . The region not only determines the date/time format but also the 
      time zone abbreviations if the zone mapping setting is on.

      + english (English – no region)
      + en-GB (English – United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland)
      + en-US (English – United States of America)
      + en-CA (English – Canada)
      + en-AU (English – Commonwealth of Australia)
      + en-NZ (English – New Zealand)
      + en-GG (English – Bailiwick of Guernsey)
      + en-JE (English – Bailiwick of Jersey)
      + en-IM (English – Isle of Man)
      + en-MT (English – Republic of Malta)
      + en-IE (English – Republic of Ireland)
