AB  - (English) The package provides commands for those abbreviations of German phrases for which the use of thin space 
      is recommended. Setup commands  \newdhua and \newtwopartdhua are provided, as well as commands 
      for single cases (such as \zB for ‘z. B.’, saving the user from typing such as ‘z.\,B.’).

      To typeset the documentation, the  niceverb (https://ctan.org/pkg/nicetext) package, version 0.44, 
      or later, is required.
