AU  - Liu, Leo
AB  - (no language specified) The package’s principal command,  \diagbox , takes two arguments (texts for the slash-separated 
      parts of the box), and an optional argument with which the direction the slash will go, the box dimensions, 
      etc., may be controlled.

      The package also provides  \slashbox and \backslashbox commands for compatibility with the slashbox 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/slashbox) package, which it supersedes.

       diagbox depends on e-TeX (https://ctan.org/pkg/etex) as well as the packages array (https://ctan.org/pkg/array) , calc 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/calc) , fp (https://ctan.org/pkg/fp) , keyval (https://ctan.org/pkg/keyval) , 
      and pict2e (https://ctan.org/pkg/pict2e) .
