Y3  - 2026-04-10
T1  - diffcoeff
T2  - Write differential coefficients easily and consistently
AU  - Parsloe, Andrew
Y2  - 2025-12-19
PY  - 2025
AB  - (no language specified) This package allows the easy and consistent writing of ordinary, partial and other derivatives of arbitrary 
      (algebraic or numeric) order. For mixed partial derivatives, the total order of differentiation is calculated 
      by the package. Optional arguments allow specification of points of evaluation (ordinary derivatives), 
      or variables held constant (partial derivatives), and the placement of the differentiand (numerator or 
      appended).

      The package is built on  xtemplate (https://ctan.org/pkg/xtemplate) and the configurability it 
      enables, extending to differentials (including simple line elements) and jacobians.
