AU  - Krause, Dirk
AB  - (no language specified) This bundle, which provides a number of tools and libraries by Dirk Krause, is no longer available on 
      CTAN. It is now available only at  its SourceForge project page (https://sourceforge.net/project/dktools) .

      The project does not contain any LaTeX packages, but source code to build executable programs. During 
      the last years, many programs unrelated to LaTeX have been added. Therefore, the CTAN is no longer a 
      suitable place to host the entire project.

      The programs related to LaTeX are:

      +  wxdkdraw : Minimalistic drawing program for use with LaTeX
      +  wxd2lat : Convert wxdkdraw drawings to PDF+TeX, EPS+TeX, TeX (PGF)
      +  bmpp (https://ctan.org/pkg/bmpp) : Convert PNG, JPEG, TIFF to PDF, PS, EPS
      +  fig2lat (https://ctan.org/pkg/fig2lat) : Convert *.fig to PS(+TeX), PDF(+TeX), PGF
      +  dk-t2l : Convert plain text to LaTeX
      +  plpdftex : Output driver for octpgfpl to produce PDF+TeX
