AB  - (no language specified) Domain coloring is a technique to visualize complex functions by assigning a color to each point of the 
      complex plane  'z' = 'x' +i 'y' .

      This package calculates with the help of Lua any complex function to visualize its behaviour. The value 
      of the complex function( 'z' ) can be described by radius and angle which can be two values of 
      the hsv-color model, which then defines the color of each point in the complex plane 'z' = 'x' +i 'y' .
