      graph layout, and to transform the output from Graphviz to LaTeX code. The generated code relies on the TikZ 
      and PGF (https://ctan.org/pkg/pgf) package or the PSTricks (https://ctan.org/pkg/pstricks-base) package. 
      The process is automated if shell escape is enabled.
