PY  - 1994
AB  - (no language specified) The collection comprises:

      + dvibook, which will rearrange the pages of a DVI file into ‘signatures’ as used when printing a book;

      +  dviconcat (https://ctan.org/pkg/dviconcat) , for concatenating pages of DVI file(s);
      +  dviselect , which will select pages from one DVI file to create a new DVI file;
      +  dvitodvi , which will rearrange the pages of a DVI file to create a new file; and
      +  libtex , a library for manipulating the files, from the old SeeTeX project.
The utilities are provided as C source with Imakefiles, and an MS-DOS version of dvibook is also provided.
