T1  - dvistd
T2  - A standard for DVI drivers
AU  - TUG DVI Standards Working Group
AB  - (no language specified) There's nothing written by Knuth that provides a “standard” for what DVI drivers actually do; users are 
      commonly referred to the sources of  dvitype (https://ctan.org/pkg/dvitype) , but that doesn't 
      actually specify anything (merely tells you how the utility works).

      The DVI standards working group set out to produce a comprehensive specification of what device drivers 
      should do. The present “level 0” is as far as the effort got.
