AU  - Fogg, Josh
AB  - (no language specified) A report and thesis class file for  The School of Mathematics, Scotland (https://www.maths.ed.ac.uk/) at 
      the University of Edinburgh (UoE) (https://www.ed.ac.uk/) . When working on a report or thesis, 
      an easy way to implement the University's typesetting rules (https://www.ed.ac.uk/academic-services/students/thesis-submission) in 
      LaTeX is provided by edmaths.sty (https://github.com/Foggalong/edinburgh-math-latex/blob/master/edmaths.sty) . 
      It sets the page margins as required and defines commands to create the correct cover page and standard 
      declaration. A compiled version of the included example can be found here (https://foggalong.github.io/edinburgh-math-latex/example-report.pdf) .

      It also loads the  amsmath (https://ctan.org/pkg/amsmath) , amsthm (https://ctan.org/pkg/amsthm) , amscd 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/amscd) , and amssymb (https://ctan.org/pkg/amsfonts) packages, which are 
      required by almost all mathematical publications. Through setspace (https://ctan.org/pkg/setspace) line 
      spacing settings are available that only affect the body text and not footnotes and captions. Additional 
      in-built options can be found in more detail in the project's documentation.
