AB  - (no language specified) A package for typesetting scholarly critical editions, replacing the established  ledmac (https://ctan.org/pkg/ledmac) package. 
      Ledmac itself was a LaTeX port of the plain TeX EDMAC (https://ctan.org/pkg/edmac) macros.

      The package supports indexing by page and by line numbers, and simple tabular- and array-style environments.

      The package is distributed with the related  eledpar (https://ctan.org/pkg/eledpar) package. The 
      package is now superseded by reledmac (https://ctan.org/pkg/reledmac) .
