T2  - EMPHasizing EQuations
AU  - Høgholm, Morten
AU  - Wright, Joseph
AU  - The LaTeX Project Team
AU  - Madsen, Lars
AU  - Robertson, Will
Y2  - 2020-03-24
PY  - 2020
AB  - (no language specified) This package is part of the  mathtools (https://ctan.org/pkg/mathtools) bundle. it provides a visual 
      markup extension to amsmath (https://ctan.org/pkg/amsmath) . The user-friendly interface allows 
      the user to put a set of equations inside a box thus enhancing the \boxed feature of amsmath. As 
      a side effect it is also possible to add material on both sides of the equations thus providing (and 
      surpassing) the functionality of the cases (https://ctan.org/pkg/cases) package. Users of ntheorem 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/ntheorem) will probably want to have a look at it as well, since the problem 
      with end-of-theorem marks in gather and other environments can be circumvented using empheq .
