AB  - (no language specified) The package is a companion for the  enumitem (https://ctan.org/pkg/enumitem) package; it makes 
      it possible to reference any item in lists formatted by enumitem lists, viz., enumerated, itemize and 
      description lists, and any list defined (or customised) with \newlist or \setlist .

      References may be typeset differently with options/properties and even arbitrary text. With  hyperref 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/hyperref) , anchors are added for each item to enable hyperlinks within the 
      document or even to external documents.

      Three schemes are provided to make reference names (including the standard  \label command).

      The package is currently broken, cf.  https://tex.stackexchange.com/q/664886/1090 (https://tex.stackexchange.com/q/664886/1090)
