AU  - The TeX Live Team
AU  - Breitenlohner, Peter
AB  - (no language specified) An extended version of TeX (capable of running as if it were unmodified TeX). E-TeX has been specified 
      by the LaTeX team as the base engine for LaTeX2e. Thus, LaTeX programmers may assume e-TeX functionality, 
      along with additional extensions.

      The  pdftex engine (https://ctan.org/pkg/pdftex) and others directly incorporate the e-TeX extensions. 
      The etex program in most distributions is an incarnation of pdftex running in DVI mode.

      The development source for e-TeX is the  TeX Live source (https://ctan.org/pkg/texlive-source) repository, 
      although further extensions have taken place in the pdftex and other engine sources, keeping e-TeX 
      stable.
