AB  - (no language specified) This bundle provides two packages,  bibpes and fetchbibpes . This pair of packages was motivated 
      by a friend, who was preparing Bible studies lessons using a combination of the application e-Sword 
      (http://www.e-sword.net/) and LaTeX. He wanted a ‘database’ of Bible packages from which he could 
      simply ‘fetch’ passages into the LaTeX source file.

      Package  bibpes is used to develop a database of verses, and package fetchbibpes is used 
      to fetch the verses.
