      Fntguide is part of a set of documentation that also covers  new LaTeX 2e commands (https://ctan.org/pkg/usrguide) , class 
      and package writing (https://ctan.org/pkg/clsguide) , typesetting Cyrillic (https://ctan.org/pkg/cyrguide) , LaTeX 
      font encodings (https://ctan.org/pkg/encguide) , configuration options (https://ctan.org/pkg/cfgguide) and modification 
      of latex (https://ctan.org/pkg/modguide) .
