      +  overrightarrow (https://ctan.org/pkg/overrightarrow) , defining a doubled over-arrow macro;
      +  removefr (https://ctan.org/pkg/removefr) , for removing ‘reset’ relations between counters; and

      +  subscript (https://ctan.org/pkg/subscript) , defining a \textsubscript command.
