AB  - (no language specified) Geomsty is a LaTeX 2.09 document style, loosely based on the standard book and article styles.

      It provides: inclusion of PostScript figures, and of TeX text within figures; automatic creation of index 
      entries and cross-references where appropriate; no need to worry about fragile commands in almost all 
      situations; greater versatility in defining theorem-like environments; proofing aids such as version 
      numbers and a running index.
