      a cut commissioned from Monotype in 1927. The present version was provided by the  Greek Font Society 
      (https://greekfontsociety-gfs.gr/) .

      The font supports both Greek and Latin characters, and has been adjusted to work well with the  cmbright 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/cmbright) fonts for mathematics support. LaTeX support of the fonts is provided, 
      offering OT1, T1 and LGR encodings.
