TY  - ICOMM
UR  - https://ctan.org/pkg/greek-makeindex
Y3  - 2025-02-07
T1  - greek-makeindex
T2  - Makeindex working with Greek
AU  - Syropoulos, Apostolos
AB  - (no language specified) Makeindex (https://ctan.org/pkg/makeindex) is resolutely stuck with Latin-based alphabets, so 
      will not deal with Greek indexes, unaided. This package provides a Perl script that will transmute the 
