AB  - (no language specified) This package provides many preset yet customizable graph paper backgrounds. Some of the preset patterns 
      include standard quadrille or graph pattern, dot grid, hexagons, isometric or triangular grid, squares 
      with 45° “light cone” lines, ruled, and more. Pattern sizes can be controlled via package options. There 
      are several preset color palletes, and colors can be overridden.

      The package uses the  PGF/TikZ (https://ctan.org/pkg/pgf) package, and the geometry package to 
      control page size.
