AB  - (no language specified) This package provides is a simple LaTeX2e class that allows guitarists to create basic guitar tablatures 
      using LaTeX. Create music and do not be bothered with macro programming.

      The class depends on the LaTeX packages  geometry (https://ctan.org/pkg/geometry) , harmony 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/harmony) , inputenc (https://ctan.org/pkg/inputenc) , intcalc (https://ctan.org/pkg/intcalc) , musixtex 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/musixtex) , tikz (https://ctan.org/pkg/pgf) , and xifthen (https://ctan.org/pkg/xifthen) , 
      as well as the article (https://ctan.org/pkg/article) class.
