AB  - (no language specified) Provides the  H option for floats in LaTeX to signify that the environment is not really a float 
      (and should therefore be placed “here” and not float at all). The package emulates an older package of 
      the same name, which has long been suppressed by its author.

      The job is done by nothing more than loading the  float (https://ctan.org/pkg/float) package, which 
      has long provided the option in an acceptable framework.
