      an action if it is not. This is done by using the  allfalse environment and passing in a string 
      and an action to be performed if the string is not contained in the set. Then, passing in a string to 
      the \orcheck macro inside the respective allfalse environment adds that to the set of strings.

      This package does not work with the LuaTeX engine.
