AB  - (no language specified) The package defines multiple level lists within one list-like environment. instead of writing  |
\begin{enumerate}
\item 1
\begin{enumerate}
\item 2
\begin{enumerate}
\item 3
\begin{enumerate}
\item 4
\end{enumerate}
\end{enumerate}
\item 2.1
\end{enumerate}
\item 1.1
\begin{enumerate}
\item 2
\end{enumerate}
\end{enumerate}
| this package allows you to write |
\begin{enumerate}
\item 1
\iitem 2
\iiitem 3
\ivtem 4
\iitem 2.1
\item 1.1
\iitem 2
\end{enumerate}
|
