AB  - (no language specified) This package enables the user to produce and typeset one or more indices simultaneously.

      The package is known to work in LaTeX documents processed with pdfLaTeX, XeLaTeX and LuaLaTeX. If  makeindex 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/makeindex) is used for processing the index entries, no particular setup is 
      needed when TeX Live is used. Using xindy (https://ctan.org/pkg/xindy) or other programs, it is 
      necessary to enable shell escape. Shell escape is also needed if splitindex (https://ctan.org/pkg/splitindex) is 
      used.

      This is a fork of  imakeidx (https://ctan.org/pkg/imakeidx) , with new features and fixed bugs.
