      at the end of their argument, and the command \upright that provides italic correction in front 
      of its argument as necessary. A command \emph is also provided, choosing between \ital and \upright according 
      to the state of the surrounding text.

      These facilities are (of course) provided in LaTeX 2e, with different names as part of the distribution.
