       (u)pTeX (https://ctan.org/pkg/ptex) . The functions currently available include:

      + The mutual conversion between Japanese virtual fonts (pairs of VF and JFM) and files in the “ZVP format”, 
        which is an original text format representing data in virtual fonts. This function can be seen as a counterpart 
        to the  vftovp / vptovf programs.
      + The mutual conversion between VF files alone and files in the “ZVP0 format”, which is a subset of the 
        ZVP format.
