AB  - (no language specified) Miscellaneous macros by Jörg Knappen, including:

      +  represent counters in greek (https://ctan.org/pkg/greekctr) ;
      +  Maxwell's non-commutative division (https://ctan.org/pkg/holtpolt) ;
      +  latin1jk (https://ctan.org/pkg/latin1jk) , latin2jk (https://ctan.org/pkg/latin2jk) and latin3jk 
        (https://ctan.org/pkg/latin3jk) , which are their inputenc (https://ctan.org/pkg/inputenc) definition 
        files that allow verbatim input in the respective ISO Latin codes;
      +  blackboard bold fonts in maths (https://ctan.org/pkg/mathbbol) ;
      +  use of RSFS fonts in maths (https://ctan.org/pkg/mathrsfs) ;
      +  extra alignments for  \parbox es (https://ctan.org/pkg/parboxx) ;
      +  swap Roman and Sans fonts (https://ctan.org/pkg/sans) ;
      +  transliterate semitic languages (https://ctan.org/pkg/semtrans) ;
      +  patches to make (La)TeX formulae embeddable in SGML (https://ctan.org/pkg/sgmlcmpt) ;
      +  use maths “minus” in text as appropriate (https://ctan.org/pkg/smartmn) ;
      +  simple Young tableaux (https://ctan.org/pkg/young) .
