      class uses the combine (https://ctan.org/pkg/combine) class and the hyperref (https://ctan.org/pkg/hyperref) package 
      to produce either a colour hyperlinked book for on-line viewing or a greyscale nonhyperlinked book for 
      printing.

      Production editors can use  makejmlrbookgui (http://www.dickimaw-books.com/software/makejmlrbookgui) to 
      help build the proceedings from the articles.
