AB  - (no language specified) The  jslectureplanner package facilitates the generation and management of university course material. 
      It provides an interface to set up and access centralized course data that can be reused in all course 
      documents. Furthermore, the package is able to calculate the session dates of a whole semester and generate 
      course programs, if the course is held weekly and the date of the first lecture is specified. Moreover, 
      the package can be used to generate a sectioned course bibliography via BibLaTeX (https://ctan.org/pkg/biblatex) .

      The bundle also includes a package  jsmembertable.sty that helps in generating course member and 
      presence lists.
