      The class is based on the  scrbook (https://ctan.org/pkg/scrbook) class of the KOMA-script (https://ctan.org/pkg/koma-script) bundle 
      in combination with the ClassicThesis (https://ctan.org/pkg/classicthesis) and ArsClassica (https://ctan.org/pkg/arsclassica) packages. 
      It modifies some of the layout and style definitions of these packages in order to provide a document 
      layout that should be compatible with the requirements by KSP.
