AB  - (no language specified) m-pictex.sty (https://ctan.org/pkg/m-pictex) was a wrapper for a ConTeXt module making picTeX 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/pictex) more easily usable in classic TeX with no e-TeX (https://ctan.org/pkg/etex) extensions.

       m-pictex.sty is here adjusted to be a stub loading pictex.sty (https://ctan.org/pkg/pictex) . 
      This has not been needed in LaTeX or ConTeXt for decades, but old documents may be using this name.
