Y3  - 2025-02-10
T1  - ltxkeys
T2  - A robust key parser for LaTeX
AU  - Musa, Ahmed
AB  - (no language specified) The package provides facilities for creating and managing keys in the sense of the  keyval (https://ctan.org/pkg/keyval) and xkeyval 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/xkeyval) packages, but it is intended to be more robust and faster. Its robustness 
      comes from its ability to preserve braces in key values throughout parsing. The need to preserve braces 
      in key values arises often in parsing keys (for example, in the xwatermark (https://ctan.org/pkg/xwatermark) package). 
      The package is faster than xkeyval (https://ctan.org/pkg/xkeyval) package because (among other 
      things) it avoids character-wise parsing of key values (called “selective sanitization” by the xkeyval 
      package).

      The package also provides functions for defining and managing keys.
