      Parameters can be specified by adding a “ 'recipe' ” file. These recipe files describe the parameter’s 
      type, placeholders and/or default values. From thereon, the placeholders can be displayed in the document 
      and an “ 'example' ” document can be created. An “ 'actual copy' ” document can be created 
      by loading additional “ 'payload' ” files, which all must correspond to a recipe file.
