T1  - luainputenc
T2  - Replacing inputenc for use in LuaTeX
AU  - Roux, Élie
AU  - Pégourié-Gonnard, Manuel
AB  - (no language specified) LuaTeX operates by default in UTF-8 input; thus LaTeX documents that need 8-bit character-sets need special 
      treatment. (In fact, LaTeX documents using UTF-8 with “traditional” — 256-glyph — fonts also need support 
      from this package.)

      The package, therefore, replaces the LaTeX standard  inputenc (https://ctan.org/pkg/inputenc) for 
      use under LuaTeX. With a current LuaTeX, the package has the same behaviour with LuaTeX as inputenc has 
      under pdfTeX.
