AB  - (no language specified) m-pictex used to be a ConTeXt MK II module making PicTeX (https://ctan.org/pkg/pictex) available 
      without e-TeX (https://ctan.org/pkg/etex) .

      The ConTeXt code is no longer distributed. The LaTeX wrapper has not been needed since LaTeX switched 
      to e-TeX 20 years ago.

      However a LaTeX  m-pictex.sty is available via the latex-context-ppchtex (https://ctan.org/pkg/latex-context-ppchtex) package. 
      It simply loads PicTeX (https://ctan.org/pkg/pictex) , for compatibility of old documents using m-pictex rather 
      than pictex .
