      version of MPSZ algebraic notation.

      Features include spaces, rotated, blank, and concealed tiles, as well as red fives. The size of the mahjong 
      tiles can be controlled using a package option and an optional argument of \mahjong.

      It is primarily aimed at Riichi (aka. Japanese) Mahjong but can be used to typeset any style of mahjong.
