Y3  - 2025-02-07
T1  - makecell
T2  - Tabular column heads and multilined cells
AU  - Lapko, Olga
AB  - (no language specified) This package supports common layouts for tabular column heads in whole documents, based on one-column 
      tabular environment. In addition, it can create multi-lined tabular cells.

      The Package also offers:

      + a macro which changes the vertical space around all the cells in a tabular environment (similar to the 
        function of the  tabls (https://ctan.org/pkg/tabls) package, but using the facilities of the array 
        (https://ctan.org/pkg/array) )
      + macros for multirow cells, which use the facilities of the  multirow (https://ctan.org/pkg/multirow) package;

      + macros to number rows in tables, or to skip cells;
      + diagonally divided cells;
      + horizontal lines in tabular environments with defined thickness.
