Y3  - 2025-02-07
T1  - manyfoot
T2  - Adds footnote levels to standard LaTeX’s footnote mechanism
AU  - Rozhenko, Alexander I.
Y2  - 2019-08-03
PY  - 2019
AB  - (no language specified) Implements a command,  \newfootnote , that adds footnote levels to standard LaTeX’s footnote mechanism. 
      Footnotes of every additional level are automatically grouped together on a LaTeX2e output page and are 
      separated from other levels by special vertical spaces. The command \newfootnote allows customisation 
      of the way foonotes of additional level are represented in LaTeX2e documents. Two customisation styles 
      are available now: the plain style is the ordinary LaTeX style of footnote representation; the para style 
      causes footnotes to be typeset as a run-in paragraph.

      This package is part of the  ncctools (https://ctan.org/pkg/ncctools) bundle.
UR  - https://ctan.org/tex-archive/macros/latex/contrib/ncctools/doc/manyfoot.pdf
