AB  - (no language specified) The package offers LaTeX support for Microsoft Georgia and ITC Franklin Gothic fonts. Support is available 
      both for text and mathematics.

      The fonts are supplied, for example, with Microsoft Windows distributions. The distributed fonts are 
      available in TrueType format; to use the package, a user must translate the fonts to Type 1 format (using, 
      for example,  ttf2pt1 (https://ctan.org/pkg/ttf2pt1) ).

      The maths support is very preliminary: much work remains on individual kerning and glyph placement ….
