AB  - (no language specified) This LaTeX package provides both syntactic and semantic helpers to typeset mathematics in LaTeX. The 
      syntactic layer eases typesetting of formulae in general, while the semantic layer provides commands 
      like  \inner{x}{y} to unify typesetting of inner products. These not only unify typesetting of 
      math formulae but also allow to easily adapt notation if a user prefers to.

      The semantic layer is split into topics.
