AU  - Wilson, Peter R.
AU  - Madsen, Lars
Y2  - 2025-11-04
PY  - 2025
AB  - (no language specified) The memoir class is for typesetting poetry, fiction, non-fiction, and mathematical works.

      Permissible document ‘base’ font sizes range from 9 to 60pt. There is a range of page-styles and well 
      over a dozen chapter-styles to choose from, as well as methods for specifying your own layouts and designs. 
      The class also provides the functionality of over thirty of the more popular packages, thus simplifying 
      document sources.

      Users who wish to use the  hyperref (https://ctan.org/pkg/hyperref) package, in a document written 
      with the memoir class, should also use the memhfixc (https://ctan.org/pkg/memhfixc) package (part 
      of this bundle). Note, however, that any current version of hyperref actually loads the package automatically 
      if it detects that it is running under memoir.
