UR  - https://ctan.org/pkg/memoize
Y3  - 2025-02-07
T1  - Memoize
T2  - Externalization of graphics and memoization of compilation results in general
AU  - Živanović, Sašo
Y2  - 2024-12-02
PY  - 2024
AB  - (no language specified) Memoize is a package for externalization of graphics and memoization of compilation results in general, 
      allowing the author to reuse the results of compilation-intensive code. Memoize (i) induces very little 
      overhead, as all externalized graphics is produced in a single compilation. It features (ii) automatic 
      recompilation upon the change of code or user-adjustable context, and (iii) automatic externalization 
      of  TikZ (https://ctan.org/pkg/pgf) pictures and Forest (https://ctan.org/pkg/forest) trees, 
      easily extensible to other commands and environments. Furthermore, Memoize (iv) supports cross-referencing, TikZ 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/pgf) overlays and Beamer (https://ctan.org/pkg/beamer) , (v) works with 
      all major engines and formats, and (vi) is adaptable to any workflow.
