T1  - mensa-tex
T2  - Typeset simple school cafeteria menus
AU  - Friedl, Sebastian
Y2  - 2017-12-03
PY  - 2017
AB  - (no language specified) This package provides a flexible LaTeX2e class for typesetting school cafeteria menus consisting of two 
      lunches (with dessert), and dinner.

      It supports two different layouts:

      + The first layout is optimized for printing the menu on A4 paper.
      + The second layout is optimized for smartphone screens and uses one (A6 sized) page per day.
Supported localizations are English (GB/US) and German. A way of defining additional localizations is 
      described in the documentation.

      The package requires  array (https://ctan.org/pkg/array) , colortbl (https://ctan.org/pkg/colortbl) , datetime2 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/datetime2) , datetime2-calc (https://ctan.org/pkg/datetime2) , geometry 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/geometry) , graphicx (https://ctan.org/pkg/graphicx) , lmodern (https://ctan.org/pkg/lm) , textcomp 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/textcomp) , and xcolor (https://ctan.org/pkg/xcolor) .
