AU  - Sank, Daniel Thomas
Y2  - 2016-12-27
PY  - 2016
AB  - (no language specified) LaTeX sections have absolute depth, e.g.  \section , \subsection , etc. When composing modular 
      documents, we want 'relative' depths.

      The  coseoul (https://ctan.org/pkg/coseoul) package provides relative headings, but does not get 
      things right when composing a document modularly from multiple parts. This package provides the missing 
      piece.

       modular relies on coseoul (https://ctan.org/pkg/coseoul) , import (https://ctan.org/pkg/import) , 
      and ifthen (https://ctan.org/pkg/ifthen) .
