      course materials. Tailored for faculty members and academic staff in Afghanistan, it adheres to rigorous 
      scholarly standards while offering customizable layouts for bilingual (e.g., Dari-English) or multilingual 
      content. Key features include preconfigured chapter/section styles, support for complex scripts, and 
