AU  - Lím, Drahoslav
AB  - (no language specified) A package to use the MathTime and MathTimePLUS (“MathTime complete”) fonts, as distributed by Y&Y, inc, 
      in LaTeX2e. Everything is included, including (patched) font metrics, except, of course, the Type 1 fonts 
      themselves. The package cooperates with the AMS packages (amsmath, amssymb, etc.); T1 and OT1 encodings 
      (as operator fonts) are fully supported. The package does not assume you own any other commercial (non-printer-resident) 
      fonts.

      This package has no connection with the  mathtime (https://ctan.org/pkg/mathtime-ltx) package by 
      Frank Mittelbach and David Carlisle, commissioned by Y&Y. Furthermore, there is no guarantee that the 
      package will work with the “MathTime Pro” fonts distributed by Personal TeX Inc (which have superseded 
      the Y&Y distribution).
