T1  - multilang
T2  - A LaTeX package for maintaining multiple translations of a document
AU  - Grewe, Richard
AB  - (no language specified) Maintaining a LaTeX document with translations for multiple languages can be cumbersome and error-prone. 
      This package provides a set of macros for defining macros and environments as wrappers around existing 
      macros and environments. These wrappers allow one to clearly specify multiple translations for the arguments 
      to the wrapped macros and environments while only the translation of the document’s language is actually 
      shown. Choosing a translation then is as simple as choosing the document’s language via babel or polyglossia.
