AB  - (no language specified) This package makes available the most commonly used symbols in writing about music in a way that can 
      be used with  pdfLaTeX (https://ctan.org/pkg/pdftex) and looks consistent and attractive.

      It includes accidentals, meters, and notes of different rhythmic values.

      The package builds on the approach used in the  harmony (https://ctan.org/pkg/harmony) package, 
      where the symbols are taken from the MusiXTeX fonts (https://ctan.org/pkg/musixtex-fonts) . But 
      it provides a larger range of symbols and a more flexible, user-friendly interface written using xparse 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/xparse) and stackengine (https://ctan.org/pkg/stackengine) .
