Y3  - 2025-02-07
T1  - ncctools
T2  - A collection of general packages for LaTeX
AU  - Rozhenko, Alexander I.
Y2  - 2019-08-03
PY  - 2019
AB  - (no language specified) The NCCtools bundle contains many packages for general use under LaTeX; many are also used by  NCC 
      LaTeX (https://ctan.org/pkg/ncclatex) . The bundle includes tools for:

      +  executing commands after a package is loaded (https://ctan.org/pkg/afterpackage) ;
      +  watermarks (https://ctan.org/pkg/watermark) ;
      +  counter manipulation (https://ctan.org/pkg/dcounter) (dynamic counters, changing counter numbering 
        with another counter);
      +  improvements to the description environment (https://ctan.org/pkg/desclist) ;
      +  hyphenation of compound words (https://ctan.org/pkg/extdash) ;
      +  new levels of footnotes (https://ctan.org/pkg/manyfoot) ;
      +  space-filling patterns (https://ctan.org/pkg/mboxfill) ;
      +  “poor man’s” Black Board Bold symbols (https://ctan.org/pkg/nccbbb) ;
      +  alignment of the content of a box (https://ctan.org/pkg/nccboxes) ;
      +  use comma as decimal separator (https://ctan.org/pkg/ncccomma) ;
      +  boxes with their own crop marks (https://ctan.org/pkg/ncccropbox) ;
      +  page cropmarks (https://ctan.org/pkg/ncccropmark) ;
      +  improvements to fancy headers (https://ctan.org/pkg/nccfancyhdr) ;
      +  float “styles”, mini floats, side floats (https://ctan.org/pkg/nccfloats) ;
      +  manually marked footnotes (https://ctan.org/pkg/nccfoots) ;
      +  extension of amsmath (https://ctan.org/pkg/nccmath) ;
      +  control of paragraph skip (https://ctan.org/pkg/nccparskip) ; an envelope to the graphicx package 
        (https://ctan.org/pkg/nccpic) ;
      +  dashed and multiple rules (https://ctan.org/pkg/nccrules) ;
      +  alternative techniques for declarations of sections, captions, and toc-entries (https://ctan.org/pkg/nccsect) ;

      +  generalised text-stretching (https://ctan.org/pkg/nccstretch) ;
      +  generation of new theorem-like environments (https://ctan.org/pkg/nccthm) ;
      +  control of the text area (https://ctan.org/pkg/textarea) ;
      +  centred page layouts (https://ctan.org/pkg/tocenter) ; and
      +  un-numbered top-level section (https://ctan.org/pkg/topsection) .
