AB  - (no language specified) The package provides a friendly interface for defining the meaning of Unicode characters. The document 
      should be processed by (pdf)LaTeX with the unicode option of  inputenc (https://ctan.org/pkg/inputenc) or inputenx 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/inputenx) , or by XeLaTeX/LuaLaTeX. The command provided is

       \newunicodechar{<char>}{<code>} 

      where  <char> is a directly-typed Unicode character, and <code> is its replacement.
