Y3  - 2025-02-07
T1  - palette
T2  - Create palettes for colors and symbols that can be swapped in
AU  - Chen, Dennis
Y2  - 2021-07-29
PY  - 2021
AB  - (no language specified) The package `palette` contains two files: `colorpalette.sty` and `symbolpalette`. One deals with colors 
      and the other deals with symbols; the implementation is quite similar.

      With this package you can create themes. Each of these themes have a set of colors, and you can create 
      palettes based on this theme with specific color values for each of the theme's color slots. The active 
