UR  - https://ctan.org/pkg/pax
Y3  - 2025-02-07
T1  - pax
T2  - Extract and reinsert PDF annotations with pdfTeX
AU  - Roucariès, Bastien
AU  - Oberdiek, Heiko
Y2  - 2022-06-07
PY  - 2022
AB  - (no language specified) If PDF files are included using  pdfTeX (https://ctan.org/pkg/pdftex) , PDF annotations are stripped. 
      The pax project offers a solution without altering pdfTeX. A Java program (pax.jar) parses the PDF file 
      that will later be included. The program then writes the data of the annotations into a file that can 
      be read by TeX.

      The LaTeX package pax extends the  graphics (https://ctan.org/pkg/graphics) package to support 
      the scheme: if a PDF file is included, the package looks for the file with the annotation data, reads 
      them and puts the annotations in the right place.

      Project status: experimental
