AU  - Vlasák, Michal
AB  - (no language specified) This package provides extra PDF features for  OpTeX (https://ctan.org/pkg/optex) (or in limited 
      form for plain LuaTeX and LuaLaTeX).

      As a minimalistic format,  OpTeX (https://ctan.org/pkg/optex) does not support “advanced” features 
      of the PDF file format in its base. This third party package aims to provide them. Summary of supported 
      features:

      + insertion of multimedia (audio, video, 3D),
      + hyperlinks and other actions,
      + triggering events,
      + transitions,
      + attachments.
