      However, it creates PDF annotations which may be viewed with Adobe Reader in place of marginal texts. 
      Small icons indicate the in-text position where the message originates, popups provide the messages themselves. 
      Thus bugfixes and other such communications are clearly visible together when viewing the document, while 
      the document itself is not obscured.
