AU  - Stacey, Andrew
AB  - (no language specified) This package provides a  TikZ (https://ctan.org/pkg/pgf) library for drawing Penrose tiles. It 
      currently supports the kite/dart, rhombus, and pentagon tile sets. There are two main methods for their 
      placement: one that automatically generates a tiling, and one that allows for “by hand” placement. Furthermore, 
      the tiles themselves can be deformed and will still (hopefully!) fit together in the correct fashion.

      This package is now superseded by package  tilings (https://ctan.org/pkg/tilings) , which deals 
      with more extensive tiles than just the Penrose tile sets.
