      with the most important TeX backend drivers, including pdfTeX and dvips. It comes with a user-friendly 
      syntax layer called TikZ.

      Its usage is similar to  pstricks (https://ctan.org/pkg/pstricks-base) and the standard picture 
      environment. PGF works with plain (pdf-)TeX, (pdf-)LaTeX, and ConTeXt. Unlike pstricks (https://ctan.org/pkg/pstricks-base) , 
      it can produce either PostScript or PDF output.
