AB  - (no language specified) This package provides support for CMYK and grayscale shadings for the  pgf (https://ctan.org/pkg/pgf) package.

      By default  pgf (https://ctan.org/pkg/pgf) used to support only RGB shadings. The package attempts 
      to produce shadings consistent with the currently selected xcolor (https://ctan.org/pkg/xcolor) colour 
      model. The rgb , cmyk , and gray colour models from the xcolor (https://ctan.org/pkg/xcolor) package 
      are supported.

       'Note:' This package has been deprecated since pgf version 3.1.3 (https://ctan.org/pkg/pgf) , 
      since CMYK and grayscale shadings are now directly supported.
