AU  - Niepraschk, Rolf
AU  - Tkadlec, Josef
AU  - Gäßlein, Hubert
Y2  - 2020-09-30
PY  - 2020
AB  - (no language specified) This package was described in the 2nd edition of ‘LaTeX: A Document Preparation System’, but the LaTeX 
      project team declined to produce the package. For a long time, LaTeX included a ‘pict2e package’ that 
      merely produced an apologetic error message.

      The new package extends the existing LaTeX picture environment, using the familiar technique (cf. the 
       graphics (https://ctan.org/pkg/graphics) and color (https://ctan.org/pkg/color) packages) 
      of driver files (at present, drivers for dvips (https://ctan.org/pkg/dvips) , pdfTeX (https://ctan.org/pkg/pdftex) , LuaTeX 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/luatex) , XeTeX (https://ctan.org/pkg/xetex) , VTeX (https://ctan.org/pkg/vtex-free) , dvipdfm 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/dvipdfm) , and dvipdfmx (https://ctan.org/pkg/dvipdfmx) are available). 
      The package documentation has a fair number of examples of use, showing where things are improved by 
      comparison with the LaTeX picture environment.
