      linenumbering, generation of separate endnotes sections for emendations, textual collations, and explanatory 
      notes, special marking for cases in which page breaks occur during stanza breaks, running headers of 
      the form ‘Notes to pp.  'xx' – 'yy' ‘ for the notes sections, index of titles and first lines, 
      and automatic generation of a table of contents.
