UR  - https://ctan.org/pkg/polski
Y3  - 2025-02-07
T1  - polski
T2  - Typeset Polish documents with LaTeX and Polish fonts
AU  - Woliński, Marcin
AU  - Olko, Mariusz
Y2  - 2021-08-25
PY  - 2021
AB  - (no language specified) Tools to typeset monolingual Polish documents in LaTeX2ε without  babel (https://ctan.org/pkg/babel) or polyglossia 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/polyglossia) . The package

      + loads Polish hyphenation patterns,
      + ensures that a font encoding suitable for Polish is used; in particular it enables Polish adaptation 
        of Computer Modern fonts (the so-called PL fonts),
      + provides translations of  \today and names like “Bibliography” or “Chapter”,
      + redefines math symbols according to Polish typographical tradition,
      + provides macros for dashes according to Polish orthography,
      + provides a historical input method for “Polish characters”,
      + works with traditional TeX as well as with Unicode aware variants.
(This package was previously known as platex, but has been renamed to resolve a name clash.)
