AU  - Story, Donald P.
Y2  - 2020-07-26
PY  - 2020
AB  - (no language specified) The package is used to create a menu structure. This menu structure (an array of menu items) is passed 
      to the Acrobat JavaScript method  app.popUpMenuEx() method to create a popup menu. Using the environments 
      defined in the package, and the command \popUpMenu , you can create and display hierarchical menus. 
      The menu items can have JavaScript actions associated with them, they can be marked and disabled.

      The package only requires  hyperref (https://ctan.org/pkg/hyperref) . Thus, users of pdfTeX, dvipdfm 
      and dvips can use this package. An example is included in the distribution.
