      by arrows representing pre- and co-requisites, and prerex , an interactive program for creating 
      and editing chart descriptions. The implementation of prerex.sty uses PGF (https://ctan.org/pkg/pgf) , 
      so that it may be used equally happily with LaTeX or pdfLaTeX; prerex itself is written in C.

      The package includes source code for a previewer application, a lightweight Qt-4 and poppler-based prerex-enabled 
      PDF viewer.
