      are used to create a PDF file ( \PDFcontainer ) that will contain all the graphics material. In 
      the final document these contents will be inserted instead of the original PostScript code.

      The package works with  pstricks (https://ctan.org/pkg/pstricks-base) and requires a recent version 
      of the preview (https://ctan.org/pkg/preview) package.
