AU  - Nowacki, Janusz Marian
AU  - Strzelczyk, Piotr
AB  - (no language specified) IMPORTANT NOTICE: This package is now considered obsolete. Please use the  TeX-Gyre (https://ctan.org/pkg/tex-gyre) fonts 
      instead!

      A collection of Type 1 fonts based on the  URW++ fonts (https://ctan.org/pkg/urw) distributed with 
      Ghostscript. The fonts are encoded according to QX layout which facilitates multilingual and technical 
      typesetting using TeX, preserving usability in Windows applications.

      The fonts have been superseded by the by the following  TeX-Gyre (https://ctan.org/pkg/tex-gyre) fonts:

      
      + The Quasi-Bookman (qbk) fonts are now available as  TeX-Gyre Bonum (https://ctan.org/pkg/tex-gyre-bonum) ;

      + the Quasi-Chancery (qzc) fonts are now available as  TeX-Gyre Chorus (https://ctan.org/pkg/tex-gyre-chorus) ;

      + the Quasi-Courier (qcr) fonts are now available as  TeX-Gyre Cursor (https://ctan.org/pkg/tex-gyre-cursor) ;

      + the Quasi-Swiss and Quasi-Swiss-Condensed (qhv) fonts are now available as  TeX-Gyre Heros (https://ctan.org/pkg/tex-gyre-heros) ;

      + the Quasi-Palatino (qpl) fonts are now available as  TeX-Gyre Pagella (https://ctan.org/pkg/tex-gyre-pagella) ; 
        and
      + the Quasi-Times (qtm) fonts are now available as  TeX-Gyre Termes (https://ctan.org/pkg/tex-gyre-termes) .
