      The bundle contains the packages ‘makematch’ for matching patterns to targets (with a generalization 
      in the form of pattern lists and keyword lists), and ‘qstest’ for performing unit tests, allowing the 
      user to run a number of logged tests ensuring the consistency of values, properties and call sequences 
      during execution of test code. Both packages make extensive use of in their package documentation, providing 
      illustrated examples that are automatically verified to work as expected.

      Check the README file for details.
