AU  - The LaTeX Project Team
AB  - (no language specified) A package to define the low-level font commands that existed in LaTeX 2.09, for the benefit of old documents 
      (or packages) that used them.

      Since this is potentially an expensive operation (loading lots of fonts), the package allows you to chop 
      and choose:

       |
\usepackage[only,tenrm,sevsf]{rawfonts}
| will load just  \tenrm and \sevsf . (This facility uses the somedefs (https://ctan.org/pkg/somedefs) package).

      The package is part of the  latex-tools (https://ctan.org/pkg/latex-tools) bundle in the LaTeX required 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/required) distribution.
