      + The  babel (https://ctan.org/pkg/babel) package for multilingual typesetting;
      + Standard LaTeX support for  using Cyrillic alphabet fonts (https://ctan.org/pkg/latex-cyrillic) ;

      + The standard LaTeX  graphics and colour packages (https://ctan.org/pkg/latex-graphics) ;
      + Basic support for using common Adobe Type 1 fonts with LaTeX—the “ psnfss (https://ctan.org/pkg/psnfss) ”; 
