AB  - (no language specified) This package provides the class RetoMatematico.cls, which is used to typeset the final solutions of the 
      mathematical challenges published in the Telegram group Retos Matemáticos (by José Manuel Sánchez Muñoz).

      Among its features, the class sets the document size to letter paper, switches the font to Palatino Linotype 
      (via the mathpazo package), and places information such as the group’s ISSN and link in the page margins.

      Further details and usage examples are available in the package documentation.
