      replace a PostScript string), \adjustrelabel (replace a PostScript string, with position adjustment), 
      and \extralabel (add a label at given coordinates).

      You can, if you so choose, use the facilities of the  labelfig (https://ctan.org/pkg/labelfig) package 
      in place of using \extralabel .
