      It is however recommended to use this package in server-mode together with the Python  talk2stat (https://pypi.org/project/talk2stat/) package. 
      Currently, this server-mode supports Julia, MatLab, Python, and R. More languages will be added. For 
      more details and usage examples, refer to the package’s github repository (https://github.com/Ossifragus/runcode) .
