For the 
      time being, the whole package splits up into individual packages for informatics (including syntax diagrams, 
      Nassi–Shneiderman diagrams, sequence diagrams, object diagrams, and class diagrams) as well as classes 
      for written exams (tests, quizzes, teaching observations, information sheets, worksheets, and answer 
      keys).
