      fact, seminar is not nowadays reckoned a good basis for a presentation — users are advised to use more 
      recent classes such as powerdot (https://ctan.org/pkg/powerdot) or beamer (https://ctan.org/pkg/beamer) , 
      both of which are tuned to 21st-century presentation styles.

