AU  - Jeffrey, Alan
AU  - The LaTeX Project Team
Y2  - 1994-06-01
PY  - 1994
AB  - (no language specified) A programmer’s toolkit package for use by package writers supporting the provision of options which switch 
      definitions contained in a package on and off through package options. It thus does not require all of 
      the package to be loaded into memory.

      The package is part of the  latex-tools (https://ctan.org/pkg/latex-tools) bundle in the LaTeX required 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/required) distribution.
