      slideshows with song lyrics. This is typically used in religious services in churches equipped with a 
      projector, for which this package has been written, but it can be useful for any type of singing assembly. 
      It provides environments to describe a song in a natural way, and formatting it into slides with overlays.

      The package comes with an additional Python script that can be used to convert plain-text song lyrics 
      to the expected LaTeX markup.
