Y2  - 2018-09-12
PY  - 2018
AB  - (no language specified) The package provides a means of producing beautiful song books for church or fellowship. It offers:

      + a very easy chord-entry syntax;
      + multiple modes (words-only; words+chords; slides; handouts);
      + measure bars;
      + guitar tablatures;
      + automatic transposition;
      + scripture quotations;
      + multiple indexes (sorted by title, author, important lyrics, or scripture references); and
      + projector-style output generation, for interactive use.
A set of example documents is provided.
