      including rules, leaders and even pictures ( pgf (https://ctan.org/pkg/pgf) , pstricks (https://ctan.org/pkg/pstricks-base) , 
      etc.). Unlike soul (https://ctan.org/pkg/soul) underlines, which are built by repeating small elements, 
      here each chunk of text to be underlined is a single element.
