      a professional, ready-to-use structure with advanced formatting macros.

      These classes packages and configuration files could be easily extended and adapted to the style for 
      your own institution.

      spim-phdthesisthemes is part of the larger project  TeX-templates (https://www.arakhne.org/latex/tex-templates) .

