AB  - (no language specified) A class and package is provided which allows TeX pictures or other TeX code to be compiled standalone 
      or as part of a main document. Special support for pictures with beamer overlays is also provided.

      The package is used in the main document and skips extra preambles in sub-files. The class may be used 
      to simplify the preamble in sub-files. By default the  preview (https://ctan.org/pkg/preview) package 
      is used to display the typeset code without margins.

      The behaviour in standalone mode may adjusted using a configuration file  standalone.cfg to redefine 
      the standalone environment.
