AU  - Ørsted, Sebastian
AB  - (no language specified) This is a small, LuaLaTeX-only package providing you with three, sometimes useful features:

      + It allows you to make brackets  [...] “strict”, meaning that each [ must be balanced by a ] .

      + It allows you to use numbers in command names, so that you can do stuff like  \newcommand\pi12{\pi_{12}} .

      + It allows you to use numbers  'and' primes in command names, so that you can do stuff like \newcommand\pi'12{\pi 
        '_{12}} .
