      distributed with LaTeX itself, and starting with the LaTeX 2015 releases it became part of the LaTeX 
      kernel. Thus, these days this code is only necessary if you run on a 'very' old LaTeX distribution 
      and want to make use of this command.

      Subscript is one of a series of  fragments (https://ctan.org/pkg/fragments) designed for use by 
      package writers and others.
