      It has been  'obsoleted' by the NFSS command \DeclareFontFamilySubstitution added to the 
      LaTeX kernel in its 2020-02 release (cf. ltnews31 (https://www.latex-project.org/news/latex2e-news/ltnews31.pdf) ).

      Existing documents can be updated by removing  \usepackage{substitutefont} and replacing all instances 
      of \substitutefont with \DeclareFontFamilySubstitution .
