AB  - (no language specified) The bundle provides three packages:

      +  printsudoku , which provides a command \sudoku whose argument is the name of a file containing 
        a puzzle specification;

      +  solvesudoku , which attempts to find a solution to the puzzle in the file named in the argument; 
        and

      +  createsudoku , which uses the random (https://ctan.org/pkg/random) package to generate a 
        puzzle according to a bunch of parameters that the user sets via macros.
The bundle comes with a set of ready-prepared puzzle files.
