Y3  - 2025-02-07
T1  - t2
T2  - Support for using T2 encoding
AU  - Lemberg, Werner
AU  - Volovich, Vladimir
AB  - (no language specified) The T2 bundle provides a variety of separate support functions for using Cyrillic characters in LaTeX:

      
      + the  mathtext package, for using Cyrillic letters ‘transparently’ in formulae;
      + the  citehack package, for using Cyrillic (or indeed any non-ascii) characters in citation keys;

      + support for Cyrillic in BibTeX;
