      + Arrows are automatically drawn (with  PSTricks (https://ctan.org/pkg/pstricks-base) or TikZ 
        (https://ctan.org/pkg/pgf) ).
      + Macros are provided for drawing double bars, single bars crossing zero values, intervals where the function 
        is not defined, or for placing special values.
      + Many features of variations tables can be customized.
