AU  - Lück, Uwe
AB  - (no language specified) LaTeX’s figures, tables, and  \marginpar s are dangerous for footnotes (and probably also \enlargethispage ). 
      Here is a proposal (a ‘patch’ package) to help, by using \holdinginserts in a simple way. It replaces 
      the original problem with a new one — it is an experiment to find out whether the new problem is less 
      bad (or it is just a contribution to the discussion, maybe just a summary of previous work). The files 
      provide further information.
