T1  - TeX-GPC
T2  - A collection of change files for a TeX system based on GNU Pascal
AU  - Helbig, Wolfgang
AB  - (no language specified) This package contains change files for Donald E. Knuth’s suite of TeX related programs. The change files 
      ( .ch ) are to be applied to Knuth’s master files ( .web ) in the version from January 2014. 
      You can use them to build ‘TeX-GPC’, i.e., a TeX system based on the GNU Pascal Compiler version 2.1. 
      TeX-GPC runs in a Unix environment, including Mac OS X 10.2.

      This package has been succeeded by  TeX-FPC (https://ctan.org/pkg/tex-fpc) , which is based on 
      the Free Pascal Compiler.
