      The collection is available in OpenType format, only; fonts conform to the developing standards for OpenType 
      maths fonts.

       TeX-Gyre-Math-Bonum (https://ctan.org/pkg/tex-gyre-math-bonum) (to match TeX-Gyre-Bonum (https://ctan.org/pkg/tex-gyre-bonum) ), TeX-Gyre-Math-Pagella 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/tex-gyre-math-pagella) (to match TeX-Gyre-Pagella (https://ctan.org/pkg/tex-gyre-pagella) ), TeX-Gyre-Math-Schola 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/tex-gyre-math-schola) (to match TeX-Gyre-Schola (https://ctan.org/pkg/tex-gyre-schola) ) 
      and TeX-Gyre-Math-Termes (https://ctan.org/pkg/tex-gyre-math-termes) (to match TeX-Gyre-Termes 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/tex-gyre-termes) ) fonts are provided.
