AB  - (no language specified) This package uses both  tracklang (https://ctan.org/pkg/tracklang) and texosquery (https://ctan.org/pkg/texosquery) to 
      look up the locale information from the operating system and provide commands that can access locale-dependent 
      information, such as the currency symbol and decimal separator.

      The file  tex-locale.tex provides generic TeX code. The LaTeX package tex-locale.sty can 
      additionally load babel (https://ctan.org/pkg/babel) or polyglossia (https://ctan.org/pkg/polyglossia) with 
      the locale’s language setting, as well as various other packages such as fontspec (https://ctan.org/pkg/fontspec) (XeLaTeX/LuaLaTeX) 
      or fontenc (https://ctan.org/pkg/fontenc) + inputenc (https://ctan.org/pkg/inputenc) (pdfLaTeX).
