      is an unchanged TeX Live plus some Mac-specific software, but is distributed in a separate archive.

      The TeX, PDF(e)TeX, XeTeX, LuaTeX, and other engines are provided in the distribution, with several different 
      running formats each; a wide range of support programs and macro packages is also included.

      Beware: the download from CTAN is large (several GB); it comes in the form of an ISO image, and is available 
      from CTAN mirrors through the `Sources' link below.

