T1  - thmtools
T2  - Extensions to theorem environments
AU  - Chou, Yukai
AU  - Schwarz, Ulrich M.
Y2  - 2023-05-04
PY  - 2023
AB  - (no language specified) The bundle provides several packages for commonly-needed support for typesetting theorems. The packages 
      should work with kernel theorems (theorems ‘out of the box’ with LaTeX), and the  theorem (https://ctan.org/pkg/theorem) and amsthm 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/amsthm) packages.

      Features of the bundle include:

      + a key-value interface to  \newtheorem ;
      + a  \listoftheorems command;
      +  hyperref and autoref (https://ctan.org/pkg/hyperref) compatibility;
      + a mechanism for restating entire theorems in a single macro call.
