T2  - Create thumb indexes for printed books
AU  - Goldgaber, Sergey
AB  - (no language specified) The package can generate thumb indexes for your document. It features printing thumb indexes on one- 
      or two-sided pages, along with background- and foreground-color selection and full LaTeX styling of the 
      chapter numbers in the thumb indexes. The height of each thumb index is automatically chosen based on 
      the number of chapters in your document, while the width is chosen by the user.

      The package is designed to work with the  memoir (https://ctan.org/pkg/memoir) class, and also 
      requires PerlTeX (https://ctan.org/pkg/perltex) and tikz (https://ctan.org/pkg/pgf) /
