PY  - 2016
AB  - (no language specified) This is a LaTeX package allowing Feynman diagrams to be easily generated within LaTeX with minimal user 
      instructions and without the need of external programs. It builds upon the  TikZ (https://ctan.org/pkg/pgf) package 
      and leverages the graph placement algorithms from TikZ (https://ctan.org/pkg/pgf) in order to automate 
      the placement of many vertices. tikz-feynman allows fine-tuned placement of vertices so that even 
      complex diagrams can still be generated with ease.
