      tree-drawing facility by laying out tree nodes without collisions; it improves on Qtree by adding lots 
      of features from TikZ (for example, edge labels, arrows between nodes); and it improves on pst-qtree 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/pst-qtree) in being usable with pdfTeX and XeTeX.
