T1  - tokenizer
T2  - A tokenizer
AU  - Herpers, Sascha
AB  - (no language specified) A tokenizer for LaTeX.  \GetTokens{Target1}{Target2}{Source} splits source into two tokens at the 
      first encounter of a comma. The first token is saved in a newly created command with the name passed 
      as <Target1> and the second token likewise. A package option ‘ trim ’ causes leading and 
      trailing space to be removed from each token; with this option, the \TrimSpaces command is defined, 
      which removes leading and trailing spaces from its argument.
