Y3  - 2025-02-07
T1  - tracking
T2  - Adjust tracking of strings
AU  - Glazkov, Dmitry A.
AB  - (no language specified) Automatically adjust spaces between symbols in words or phrases to fit them into a specified length. 
      Any chain of symbols (including spaces) in the current font may be treated.

      Commands  \track{<length>}{<string>} (add space <length> , which may be <0, after each symbol 
      of <string> ), \fittrack{<length>}{<string>} (make <string> fit into width <length> , 
      which may be smaller than the original width) and \ratiotrack{<ratio>}{<string>} (as \fittrack , 
      with <length> replaced by <ratio> of the natural length of <string> ).
KW  - letterspace
