AB  - (no language specified) This is a LaTeX package that provides  TikZ (https://ctan.org/pkg/pgf) -based macros to make it 
      easy to draw graphs. The macros provided in this package are just abbreviations for TikZ (https://ctan.org/pkg/pgf) codes, 
      which can be complicated; but using the package will hopefully make drawing easier, especially when drawing 
      repeatedly. The macros were chosen and developed with an emphasis on drawing graphs in economics.

      The package depends on  TikZ (https://ctan.org/pkg/pgf) , xparse (https://ctan.org/pkg/xparse) , 
      and expl3 (https://ctan.org/pkg/expl3) .
