      master, and doctoral theses for the University of Brasilia (UnB), Brazil. The class also comes with a 
      template for the various types of theses for undergraduate and graduate programs at UnB.

      The documentation for the class and the comments in the templates are all written in Portuguese, the 
      language of the target audience.
