T1  - upmendex
T2  - Multilingual index processor
AU  - Tanaka, Takuji
Y2  - 2026-02-15
PY  - 2026
AB  - (no language specified) The package is a multilingual index processor with the following features:

      + Mostly compatible with makeindex and upper compatible with mendex.
      + Supports UTF-8 and works with upLaTeX, XeLaTeX and LuaLaTeX.
      + Supports Latin (including non-English), Greek, Cyrillic, Korean Hangul and Chinese Han (Hanzi ideographs) 
        scripts, as well as Japanese Kana.
      + Supports four kinds of sort orders (Pinyin, Radical-Stroke, Stroke and Zhuyin) for Chinese Han scripts 
        (Hanzi ideographs).
      + Support Brahmic (Bengali, Devanagari, Gurmukhi, Gujarati, Kannada, Lao, Malayalam, Oriya, Sinhala, Tamil, 
        Telugu, Thai), Arabic and Hebrew scripts (experimental).
      + Applies International Components for Unicode (ICU) for sorting process.
