AB  - (no language specified) LaTeX class and configuration file for typesetting a scientific or technical report following the template 
      and guidelines from the  “Connaissance et Intelligence Articielle Distribuees” (CIAD UR 7533) research 
      laboratory (https://www.ciad-lab.fr) of the Université de Technologie Belfort Montbéliard (https://www.utbm.fr) in 
      France.

      Built on top of the powerful  UPmethodology (https://ctan.org/pkg/upmethodology) suite, it provides 
      a professional, ready-to-use structure with advanced formatting macros.

      This class and configuration file could be easily extended and adapted to the style of your own institution.

      utbmciad-report is part of the larger project  TeX-templates (https://www.arakhne.org/latex/tex-templates) .

       'Note on Licensing' 

      The package contains two distinct types of material:

      * LaTeX source code (all files that are under the  src/ directory and any documentation source files).

      * University and institutions logo images (all files under the  logos/ directory).
