AU  - Harders, Harald
Y2  - 2025-01-01
PY  - 2025
AB  - (no language specified) This package is obsolete. For LaTeX-format 2020-10-01 and newer: Instead of  |\addglobalwarning{ something }| use |\AddToHook{enddocument/info}{ something }| and do not load the warning package.

      For older formats this package provides a command that generates a list of warnings that are printed 
      out at the very end of the logfile. This is useful for warnings such as ‘Rerun for this or that reason’ 
      or ‘This is a draft, change it before the final run’.
