      It is an extension of  piano.sty (https://ctan.org/pkg/piano) by Émile Daneault, written in expl3 
      in answer to a couple of questions on TeX.StackExchange:

      +  https://tex.stackexchange.com/questions/162184/ (https://tex.stackexchange.com/questions/162184/) 

      +  https://tex.stackexchange.com/questions/246276/ (https://tex.stackexchange.com/questions/246276/) .

It features extended syntax and several options, like setting the color, adding numbers for pitch analysis, 
      one or two octaves, and others.
