Y3  - 2025-02-07
T1  - xsavebox
T2  - Saveboxes for repeating content without code replication, based on PDF Form XObjects
AU  - Grahn, Alexander
Y2  - 2022-08-04
PY  - 2022
AB  - (no language specified) The package defines commands for saving content that can be repeatedly placed into the document without 
      replicating DVI/PDF code in the output file, allowing for smaller file size of the final PDF and improved 
      content caching for faster display in certain PDF viewers. The method makes use of ‘Form XObjects’ defined 
      in the PDF specification.

      The user commands are modelled after the standard LaTeX commands  \savebox , \sbox , \usebox and 
      the lrbox environment.

      All common TeX engines and back-ends are supported:

      + pdfLaTeX, LuaLaTeX
      + LaTeX → dvips → ps2pdf/Distiller
      + (Xe)LaTeX → (x)dvipdfmx
UR  - https://ctan.org/tex-archive/macros/latex/contrib/xsavebox/README.md
