AB  - (no language specified) The package provides macros and environments to document LaTeX packages and classes. It is an (as yet 
      unfinished) alternative to the  ltxdoc (https://ctan.org/pkg/ltxdoc) class and the doc (https://ctan.org/pkg/doc) or xdoc 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/xdoc) packages. The aim is to provide a different layout and more modern styles 
      (using the xcolor (https://ctan.org/pkg/xcolor) , hyperref (https://ctan.org/pkg/hyperref) packages, 
      etc.)

      This is an alpha release, and should probably not (yet) be used with other packages, since the implementation 
      might change. Nevertheless, the author uses it to document his own packages.
