      will compile on our system.

      The template has to be compiled using  XeLaTeX (https://ctan.org/pkg/xetex) and relies on scrartcl 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/koma-script) , scrlayer-scrpage (https://ctan.org/pkg/koma-script) , amsfonts 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/amsfonts) , amssymb (https://ctan.org/pkg/amsfonts) , amsmath (https://ctan.org/pkg/amsmath) , babel 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/babel) , enumitem (https://ctan.org/pkg/enumitem) , etoolbox (https://ctan.org/pkg/etoolbox) , fontspec 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/fontspec) , gensymb (https://ctan.org/pkg/gensymb) , geometry (https://ctan.org/pkg/geometry) , graphicx 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/graphicx) , mathrsfs (https://ctan.org/pkg/mathrsfs) , mathtools (https://ctan.org/pkg/mathtools) , stmaryrd 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/stmaryrd) , textcomp (https://ctan.org/pkg/textcomp) , tikz-cd (https://ctan.org/pkg/tikz-cd) , xcolor 
      (https://ctan.org/pkg/xcolor) , and xparse (https://ctan.org/pkg/xparse) .
