T1  - zebra
T2  - A collection of handy macros for (paper) writing
AU  - Xue, Ruini
Y2  - 2026-04-26
PY  - 2026
AB  - (no language specified) This package provides inline note-taking macros ( \todo , \comment , \fixed , \note , \placeholder ) 
      for collaborative paper writing. Notes are colour-coded, numbered, and marked in the margin for quick 
      scanning. A summary table and clickable note list are appended at the end of the document. Custom note 
      types and margin symbols are supported.

